These files come from Ledger's sample application and SDK and remain under the
Apache License, Version 2.0; the license text is in LICENSE-APACHE-2.0:

  src/main.c
  Makefile
  glyphs/icon_back.gif
  glyphs/icon_crossmark.gif
  glyphs/icon_dashboard.gif
  glyphs/icon_eye.gif
  glyphs/icon_validate_14.gif

The source files say so in their headers. The five glyphs are byte for byte
copies of the SDK's own; icon_back.gif and icon_dashboard.gif are its
icon_back_x.gif and icon_dashboard_x.gif. The contributors to the Elastos Ledger
app modified src/main.c and the Makefile from Ledger's originals, and each file
says so under its header.
